A lend leaves its thread's requests due within the span they had, whatever span it gives.
A client that says how soon its server must answer would be answered as late as its own binding says.

Caught-by: fuzz fuzz-pmp8 fuzz-rp2350 fuzz-smp2 fuzz-work qemu-replay
Report: a wait left its caller's requests due within another span than it gave
Witness: fuzz lend-span

